   "FavorGoods_140201_Content": "Yangyang's blue beret always has a delicate ribbon attached to its brim. It's her signature look, and a precious gift from her mother before she embarked on her journey.   \nTo Yangyang, it symbolizes her mother's blessing and marks the start of her own journey. She holds onto the resolution she made when putting on the ribbon, determined to see it through until the end.",
   "FavorGoods_140201_Title": "Striped Ribbon",
   "FavorGoods_140202_Content": "As Yangyang grew accustomed to the constant presence of Streams, she began to contemplate capturing the fleeting sound of the wind. With the help of Baizhi's modifications and innovative energy conversion technology, a device was created to store the Streams as visual and tangible information. Whether it be the gentle sound of snow falling on a mountain, an untold story, or a poignant moment that brings tears to one's eyes, Yangyang now had the ability to record these realities that her senses were attuned to.",
@@ -57373,30 +57373,30 @@
   "FavorRoleInfo_1308_TalentCertification": "The subject's waveform diagram exhibits elliptical oscillations with a stable Time Domain. No abnormal fluctuation tendencies were observed. Examination results are determined to be within normal parameters. \n \nConclusion: Resonant Criticality is high and subject stability remains robust. No immediate risk of Overclocking. \nNo history of Overclocking; however, the subject exhibits emotional instability. Psychological counseling has shown minimal efficacy.\n \n<i>\"****! In Night City, I'm practically the poster child for mental health!\"</i>\n<i>\"This sample is way too textbook... You sure someone didn't just copy-paste it from a manual?\"</i>",
   "FavorRoleInfo_1308_TalentDoc": "[██ Record Modification Log]\n\nModification Target: Rebecca\nModification Code: RA2██-G\n\nThe subject is identified as a Mutant-Type Resonator, with the Tacet Mark located on the right shoulder.\n\nForte Manifestation:\nWhen utilizing firearms originating from ██, the subject can enhance the weapons' own ballistic precision and terminal effectiveness. Building upon this foundation, the subject's attacks can neutralize and disrupt the frequency surrounding specific Nightmare Tacet Discords, inflicting additional damage to targets hit.\n\nFirearm Summoning:\nThe subject can summon three specific firearms tailored to different combat scenarios, using her Forte to materialize and dematerialize these weapons. While a weapon is being summoned, its damage output fluctuates in response to the subject's emotional state, suggesting a direct feedback loop between her Forte and the weapon's performance parameters.\n\n<i>\"The subject's frequency sample exhibits up to 97% similarity to the frequency of Nightmare Tacet Discords in the region. It is speculated that the two share a certain correlation.\"</i>\n<i>\"███ intervened. Related research terminated.\"</i>",
   "FavorRoleInfo_1308_TalentName": "Fury-Type Arsenal",
