   "GuideTutorialPage_32059_Content": "Use Rover: Spectro's Resonance Liberation - Echoing Orchestra to break Nightmare: Adam Smasher's Sandevistan time-slowing effect and restore the flow of time.",
   "GuideTutorialPage_32060_Content": "The Thousand-Puppet Pavilion's Wall Shield, Left Arm, and Head can be destroyed.\nWall Shield Destroyed: Increases the Vibration Strength depletion inflicted on the Thousand-Puppet Pavilion.\nLeft Arm Destroyed: Temporarily reduces the damage dealt by the Thousand-Puppet Pavilion.\nHead Destroyed: Greatly increases the Off-Tune Level on the Thousand-Puppet Pavilion.",
   "GuideTutorialPage_32061_Content": "When the Thousand-Puppet Pavilion prepares its ultimate skill, several unique mechanisms will manifest across the battlefield. Strike these mechanisms with Heavy Attack or Plunging Attack to deploy a protective barrier.\nStand within the effective barrier zone to nullify the ultimate skill damage. Please note that this is the only way to avoid the ultimate skill.",
-  "GuideTutorialPage_32062_Content": "",
+  "GuideTutorialPage_32062_Content": "Stay tuned",
   "GuideTutorialPage_33001_Content": "Upon reaching certain Union Levels, you need to complete <color=#ffd12f>SOL3 Phase Ascension Quests</color> to lift the <color=#ffd12f>Union Level cap</color>.",
   "GuideTutorialPage_33006_Content": "Each Tacet Field has a unique special buff.\nThe Tacet Field located in the Central Plains periodically generates a Concerto Energy Sphere, which recovers Concerto Energy and deals <color=#ffd12f>AoE DMG</color> after you cast <color=#ffd12f>Intro Skill</color>.",
   "GuideTutorialPage_33007_Content": "A very small number of Tacet Discords with mutated appearances can be randomly found in the world of Solaris-3. They are known as \"Phantoms\" for their extreme rarity. Defeat them to unlock the corresponding Phantom Echoes with special <color=#ffd12f>Echo appearances</color>.",
@@ -84733,13 +84733,13 @@
