   "HelpText_501_Title": "Where Stars Cascade Down",
   "HelpText_502_Content": "Complete event activities and limited-time tasks to earn Lollo Vouchers and other rewards.\nCollect Lollo Vouchers to reach milestone stages and claim corresponding rewards.",
   "HelpText_502_Title": "Limited-Time Rewards of Where Stars Cascade Down",
-  "HelpText_503_Content": "[About]\nDuring the event, obtain Moonlit Rings to unlock and claim rewards. Purchase merchandise tagged with <texture=/Game/Aki/UI/UIResources/UiActivity/Image/Activity31/CumulativeRecharge/Common/T_TempScoreIcon.T_TempScoreIcon,0.5/> in the <color=#ad893a>Recommended - Lunite Subscription, Bundles - Special Offers, Outfits, Lunite Purchase, etc.</color> sections of the Store to obtain Moonlit Rings.\n\nWhen the Moonlit Path event ends, the Moonlit Rings will expire and will not be converted to other items. After the event ends, any unclaimed event rewards will be reissued via in-game mail if you log in within 30 days. If you fail to log in within 30 days, the rewards will not be reissued. Don't forget to claim them in your in-game mailbox.\n\n[Eligibility]\n- Reach Union Level 5.\n- Or complete the combat trial in the Main Quest \"First Resonance.\"\n- Or access Main Quest Fast Track Event and proceed with the Main Quest until you reach a specific point.\n\n[Rules]\nDuring the event, obtain Moonlit Rings to unlock and claim rewards.\n\nLog in and enter Moonlit Path to claim: Lustrous Tide x1\nObtain 30 Moonlit Rings to claim: Radiant Tide x1\nObtain 88 Moonlit Rings to claim: Motorbike Accessory - Heart Cube\nObtain 198 Moonlit Rings to claim: Forging Tide x2\nObtain 328 Moonlit Rings to claim: Hsin Resonator Accessory - Where Dreams Shine Clear\nObtain 450 Moonlit Rings to claim: 5-star Weapon Supply Chest - Synth Armament x1 (Open to choose one weapon: Laser Shearer, Radiance Cleaver, Phasic Homogenizer, Pulsation Bracer, or Boson Astrolabe)\nObtain 680 Moonlit Rings to claim: Transducer x3\nObtain 980 Moonlit Rings to claim: Stellar Anchor of Memories x1 (Exchanged for Shorekeeper, Carlotta, or Phoebe, or Transducer x8)\nObtain 1600 Moonlit Rings to claim: Cosmetics Set x1 (Full set includes Avatar: Abby Tossing, Sigil: Not Even Close, Custom Accessory: Not Even Close)\nObtain 2200 Moonlit Rings to claim: Collection Item: Cloudview Seat x1\n\n[Note]\n- If you make purchases through any non-in-game channel, such as the official website's top-up center, please log in to the game while the event is ongoing to receive your purchases, as well as the corresponding Moonlit Rings. If you log in after the event ends, you will not receive the corresponding Moonlit Rings.",
+  "HelpText_503_Content": "Stay tuned",
   "HelpText_503_Title": "Moonlit Path",
   "HelpText_507_Content": "[Difficulty]\nEach stage comes in Easy and Hard difficulties, which involve 1 and 2 lost Exoswarm respectively.\n\n[Turn Order]\nEasy: Player and 1 Exoswarm take turns to move, and player moves first.\nHard: Player and 2 Exoswarm take turns to move in this order: Player → 1st Exoswarm→ Player → 2nd Exoswarm, repeat.\n\n[Game Rules] \n- Victory Condition: You clear the level when all Exoswarm are completely surrounded  with no way of escaping.\n- Failure Condition: You lose the level when any Exoswarm flees the current frostlands area.\n\n[Requesting Aid]\nYou may choose to accept aid from the herders after failing or resetting a level 3 and 6 times respectively. Once accepted, the herders will place several Shepherd's Staff in the frostlands in advance to make it easier to surround the Exoswarm.\n\nYou may reattempt both Easy and Hard levels after the first clearance.",
   "HelpText_507_Title": "Rein Back! Migration Mayhem!—Easy and Hard Mode Details",
@@ -93065,7 +93065,7 @@
