   "HelpText_6_Content": "<color=yellow>Character Introduction: </color>",
@@ -100319,8 +100319,8 @@
   "InfoDisplay_36050006_Title": "Scribbled Note II",
   "InfoDisplay_36050007_Text": "...\nOn Mt. Firmament, there dwells a Tacet Discord. Its form resembles a tiger, with golden eyes and a cyan face. Its back is covered in scales, and its long tail is tipped with spines. It is called the Lightstrider. Fierce by nature, it shuns company and claims the open wilds as its own. It fights with teeth and claws, its strength enough to shatter stone. When angered, it can transform its gleaming scales into projectiles, moving through the air as swiftly as a beam of light.\n\nWhen an ordinary person sees its radiance in the distance, they should fall silent and take a wide berth. On no account should they provoke it.\n\nIf caught in a narrow encounter with no way to retreat, one must still the heart and act according to the moment. When it lunges from above, meet it head‑on to break its momentum. If strength proves insufficient, seize the first chance to flee and avoid its edge. Above all, do not hesitate. A moment of doubt is a moment of ruin.",
   "InfoDisplay_36050007_Title": "Records of Huanglong Tacet Discord: Jinzhou",
-  "InfoDisplay_37000001_Text": "It still won't work. Even with Lady Hsin's techniques, the prototype burns through its energy far too fast, and its structure falls into an irreversible collapse of its own making...\nWhat am I to do... Have I taken the wrong direction entirely?\nNo, impossible. Jiening and I gave our lives to this. For her sake, I have to finish it.\n\n[A single line is written below. To your surprise, the hand is nothing like the writing above. It is your own, and it was clearly set down here a very long time ago.]\n\nFace the vase: forward, left, left, right.",
-  "InfoDisplay_37000001_Title": "[A Hastily Written Note]",
+  "InfoDisplay_37000001_Text": "Stay tuned",
+  "InfoDisplay_37000001_Title": "Stay tuned",
   "InfoDisplay_37000002_Text": "The Fifth Seal collected damaged tissues from victims to study the Evil Miasma's corrosion of the human face, leading to the blueprint for the Blight Rain protective mask. After the Second Seal crafted the prototype, the Fourth Seal replicated it into ten identical masks without sacrificing their performance, granting the Ten Seals the means to enter the Blight Rain and fight the Evil Miasma.",
   "InfoDisplay_37000002_Title": "Ten Seals Covenants' Masks",
   "InfoDisplay_37000003_Text": "1. The mechanical parts requested by the Second and Eighth Seals have arrived. Remember to pick them up.\n \n 2. The Third and Seventh Seals went to patrol the outskirts of the city. If they aren't back in six hours, inform the Seal Master.\n \n 3. The Fourth Seal has been overusing her Forte for days and needs rest. (Send Sister Suoming to keep her company, that'll lift her spirits in no time!)\n \n 5. The Fifth and Sixth Seals went to the clinic together to tend to the patients.",
